        "title": "Web sign-in button shown for signed-out users",
        "summary": "Added `SignInCardFooter` component and rendered it on `/login` and `/referrals` pages when the user is not authenticated. The `/referrals` navbar link is now always visible, previously hidden for signed-out users. `SignInButton` was moved from `navbar/` to `sign-in/` and its image rendering switched from `next/image` to native `img`.",
