        "at": "2026-09-15T18:42:53.005Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "If you're signed out of your account, you'll now see a 'Continue with GitHub' button directly on the login page and on the referrals page, instead of those pages just telling you to log in elsewhere. The referrals link in the top menu is now always visible to everyone, even when you're not signed in, so you can navigate to it without being logged in first. Behind the scenes, the team moved the sign-in button code to a dedicated folder and replaced an image-loading library with a simpler standard image tag.",
